{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-d8ee946779cd10bb09a7","statement":"For all $a,b,a',b' \\in \\Lambda \\,$ we have:\n\n- $f(a+a',b)=f(a,b)f(a',b);$\n\n- $f(a,b+b')=f(a,b)f(a,b');$\n\n- $f(b,a)= f(a,b)^{-1};$\n\n- $f(a,a)=1$; $f(a,-a)=1;$","source_id":"arXiv:math/0104184","cluster":"representation_theory","statement_sha256":"5b47451ab14473998cadf8301dfe1613b8235e036a350c7ec9ee874b59451d45","kind":"proposition","label":"Proposition 1","ref_key":"p1","name":"","order":1,"deps":[],"cite_keys":[],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0104184","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"0bbf81b396394f573e70af127716e407132452512bf251484fa886060b2ab97f","line":173,"origin":"latex_env","retrieved_at":"2026-09-29T13:49:39+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v2","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":157,"math_hints":20}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:math/0104184","title":"Imaginary Verma modules for the extended affine Lie algebra $sl_{2}(\\mathbb C_{q})$","abstract":"We consider one of the most natural extended affine Lie lagebras, the algebra $sl_2({\\mathbb C}_q)$ and begin a theory of its representations. In particular, we study a class of imaginary Verma modules, obtain a criterion of irreducibility and describe their submodule structure in \"general position\".","authors":["M. Dokuchaev","L. Vasconcellos Figueiredo","V. Futorny"],"year":"2001","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0104184","cluster":"representation_theory","macros":{"leq":"\\leqslant"},"macros_override":["leq"]},"deps":[],"dependents":[]}